{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*statь}}, related to Etymology 1 above. Cognate to {{cog|uk|стать}}, {{cog|en|stead}}, {{cog|grc|στάσις}}.

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+||f}}

# [[build]]
# [[trait]], [[character]], [[type]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[она|Она́]] [[ему́]] [[под стать|под '''стать''']].|She is a match for him.}}
# [[need]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[с какой стати|С како́й '''ста́ти''']]?|(''colloquial'') Why should I/you/he/she/it/we/they? For what reason?; why?}}

